Teda seena nahi labda<br />
<br />
teda seena nayi labda<br />
baba meh rulgay ah<br />
<br />
injh lathe hoy dur mede<br />
tenkoo rona bhulgay ah<br />
<br />
baba menkoo shaam ke loka neh tede baad kaneezi wich mangiya<br />
meh gairat syeda dee oh wele margay ah<br />
<br />
jado gal teh der zarba chaliya meh kol koloh ke dehnndi ray<br />
nahi miliya sar teda tarle kardi raya<br />
<br />
jado wakhri qaid da huqam hoya menkoo kaliya tang zindaan deh wich<br />
injh rondi meh turee ah oh qaiden meh rulgay ah<br />
<br />
dutha pehla pursa maqtal wich menkoo shimmer laieen yateemi da<br />
injh zalim hath chaya oh meh khaakh teh jhan paya ah<br />
<br />
jada dhakila hoya sham deh wich hoyi bheer bazaari loka dee<br />
phoopiya deh turan kithe oh meh raah mangdi raya<br />
<br />
tende khoon ich tarkhat zalim deh menkoo ajar risalat dehnde ray<br />
injh khums menkoo miliya oh rangeen hoya zulfa<br />
<br />
shal koy dhee na injh guzre be sarba babe dee lash utho<br />
jeew meh rasiya paah keh oh tedi lash tho guzri ah<br />
